    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39043" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιγηθέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>rejoice, triumph over</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς μήτε
